      <span itemprop="name">Do you provide itemized written estimates before treatment begins?</span>
      <span class="ml-4 flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
