    </summary>
    <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-4" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
      <div itemprop="text">
        Yes. Following comprehensive physical inspection of foundation stems, attics, or crawlspaces, the technician provides a clear, itemized written estimate detailing scope of work, targeted products, and follow-up schedules. No physical work proceeds without your authorization.
      </div>
    </div>
